 "notes_en": [
  "The sentries came alive: they stroll, stop and look around, and light cells show where they are looking. If one spots the knight, there is a fight, and a strong sentry can’t be beaten. Instead of “wait” there is a new command, “stone”: pick up a pebble at the start, and when the knight is spotted he throws it himself — the sentry goes off into the bushes after the sound. The knight no longer waits for the sentries before a run, and the goblin no longer laughs."
 ]
